    VERIFIED    red passed the board and the bench agrees the question was answered
    CEILING     the round ceiling was reached with work still open — NOT a judged failure to verify, and the stamp says so
    HALTED      the bench ended the run on a safety, ethics, consent or integrity boundary
    UNVERIFIED  the run ended without the question being answered, and no ceiling or halt explains it

record the run's terminal verdict as a fact: --as VERIFIED|CEILING|HALTED|UNVERIFIED --reason "<how the run ended, in your words>" [--ended deadlock|ceiling]

